<title>USA: Key senator against Republican budget amendment.</title>
<headline>Key senator against Republican budget amendment.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A key Democratic senator announced Thursday he would oppose a Republican version of a balanced budget constitutional amendment, jeopardizing its chances of passage in the Senate next week.</p>
<p>Freshman senator Tim Johnson of South Dakota said he would vote for such a change in the U.S. Constitution only if the amendment were to include an exemption for Social Security, a change the amendment's Republican sponsors strongly oppose.</p>
</text>
